<p>On your answer paper, write formulas for the following 
<alert> derivatives </alert> and then 
give their values at <m>x=4</m></p>
<p><alert> (A) </alert> The <alert> sum </alert>  <m>(f+g)'</m></p>
<p><m>\quad (f+g)'(4) =</m><fillin characters="5" name="AnSwEr0001"/></p>
